Package: pressR
Title: Scrape Press Releases from U.S. House Members' Websites
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zayne", "Sember", , "zaynesember@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects press releases from United States House of
    Representatives members' .house.gov websites over a date range. Detects
    the content-management system behind each site (Drupal, ASP.NET,
    WordPress, or a generic fallback) and routes to a dedicated extractor,
    fetching pages statically by default and falling back to a headless
    browser only where required.
